incorrect word.</span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.\n</span><span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "GIW", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "These days supermarkets keep flooding their shelves with different kinds of yogurts in different flavors.<br/>\nYogurt helps to balance the healthy bacteria in the body, and it is also a good source of calcium. Women's magazines claim that it even has qualities that happen to help the skin.\nWhen it is applied directly on the skin, it is supposed to heal burns. You should aim to eat it every day. But yogurt is not a new fad. It has been around for thousands of years.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "Yogurt is a staple in many cultures known for people who live long lives. Legend has it that Methuselah, who was famous in the Bible for living over 900 years, ate yogurt.<br/>\nIt is also said that King Solomon, the biblical character known for his wisdom, also enjoyed it.<br/>\nYogurt is not only made from cow's milk. Supposedly, goat's milk yogurt was eaten by the biblical patriarch Abraham. It is also believed that Genghis Khan, the great Mongol warrior, ate a lot of yak milk yogurt.", "id": 2, "time": "28500", "image": ""}, {"text": "Yogurt is easy to make at home. This is how:<br/>\nYogurt is fermented from milk and from live cultures. To make it, a spoonful of existing yogurt is supposed to be put into a cup of milk.<br/>\nThe culture in the existing yogurt is supposed to react with the milk and in a few days yogurt is made. Flavors are then supposed to be added to improve the taste. I don't know about you, but I can't stand eating plain yogurt!", "id": 3, "time": "61000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn8le12ob05re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "These days supermarkets keep flooding their shelves with different kinds of yogurts in different flavors. <br/><br/>\nYogurt helps to balance the healthy bacteria in the body, and it is also a good source of calcium. Women's magazines claim that it even has qualities that happen to help the skin. When it is applied directly on the skin, it is supposed to heal burns. You should aim to eat it every day. But yogurt is not a new fad. It has been around for thousands of years. <br/><br/>\nYogurt is a staple in many cultures known for people who live long lives. Legend has it that Methuselah, who was famous in the Bible for living over 900 years, ate yogurt. <br/> <br/>\nIt is also said that King Solomon, the biblical character known for his wisdom, also enjoyed it. <br/><br/>\nYogurt is not only made from cow's milk. Supposedly, goat's milk yogurt was eaten by the biblical patriarch Abraham. It is also believed that Genghis Khan, the great Mongol warrior, ate a lot of yak milk yogurt. <br/><br/>\nYogurt is easy to make at home. This is how:\nYogurt is fermented from milk and from live cultures. To make it, a spoonful of existing yogurt is supposed to be put into a cup of milk.\nThe culture in the existing yogurt is supposed to react with the milk and in a few days yogurt is made. Flavors are then supposed to be added to improve the taste. I don't know about you, but I can't stand eating plain yogurt!", "type": "p"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}]}]}